# Windows shells read these, so check them out with CRLF.
#
# scripts/build_windows.ps1 also carries a UTF-8 BOM on purpose: Windows PowerShell 5.1
# decodes a BOM-less file as the system ANSI code page, and that file contains Persian.
# Git only rewrites line endings here, never the BOM - do not add working-tree-encoding,
# which would re-encode the content.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf
